  "description": {
    "en": "Gamma Live Wire Professional is a premium multifilament string engineered to provide natural gut-like performance while maintaining outstanding comfort and playability. Its construction incorporates 50% more Iso-Elastic Fibers, NCP Tension Fibers for improved tension maintenance, and PEEK abrasion-resistant fibers for enhanced durability, producing a crisp, solid response preferred by advanced players.",

    "zh": "Gamma Live Wire Professional 是 Gamma 高端多芯球线，旨在提供接近天然肠线的击球体验，同时保持 Live Wire 系列出色的舒适性。它采用比标准 Live Wire 多 50% 的 Iso-Elastic Fibers、NCP 保磅纤维以及 PEEK 耐磨纤维，兼具优秀的手感、力量、控制、保磅能力与耐久性，适合追求天然肠线击球感但希望获得更高耐用性的球员。"
  },

